  /\b(i don't understand|i dont understand|i do not understand|i'm confused|i am confused|im confused|confused about|help me understand|help me with|i need help with|i need help understanding|struggling with|i'm stuck on|i am stuck on|im stuck on|i'm having trouble with|i am having trouble with|im having trouble with|i have trouble with|i don't get|i dont get|i do not get|can't figure out|cant figure out|cannot figure out|can t figure out|i get lost|i keep getting lost|i lose track|doesn't click|doesnt click|does not click|not clicking|keep mixing up|mixing up|blending together|blur together|feel interchangeable|feel basically the same|seem basically the same|stopped following|stop following|falls apart|breaks my understanding|stops making sense|throwing me off|tripping me up|messing me up|keeps messing me up|makes me shut down|makes me freeze|feel lost|feel behind|feel stupid|feel dumb|panic|spiral)\b/i;

